  "description": "NONWEV crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C56 H124 Ce6 N12 O24,0.7(C2 H3 N1). From the CIF bond table, Ce1 (Ce) has 8 O neighbors; Ce2 (Ce) has 5 O neighbors; Ce3 (Ce) has 5 O neighbors; Ce1B (Ce) has 8 O neighbors; Ce2B (Ce) has 5 O neighbors; Ce3B (Ce) has 5 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 12 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.598-3.657 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 105.77-108.71°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula Ce6O8(piv)8(deta)4·0.7CH3CN.",
